## Interface-Driven Design

**All connectors (LLM providers, MCP, A2A) MUST implement abstract interfaces.**

### ✅ CORRECT

```python
# Define interface in core/interfaces.py
class LLMProvider(ABC):
    @abstractmethod
    async def generate(self, request: LLMRequest) -> LLMResponse: ...

# Implement in llm/providers/openai.py
class OpenAIProvider(LLMProvider):
    async def generate(self, request: LLMRequest) -> LLMResponse:
        # Implementation
        pass
```

### ❌ WRONG

```python
# DON'T create providers without interface
class OpenAIProvider:  # Missing ABC inheritance
    async def generate(self, prompt: str) -> str:
        pass
```

**Rule**: Every connector/provider MUST inherit from an ABC in `core/interfaces.py`.

