## Repository Pattern

**All database access MUST go through repositories.**

### ✅ CORRECT

```python
# storage/repositories/llm_calls.py
class LLMCallRepository(Repository):
    async def create(self, data: Dict) -> str:
        result = await self.collection.insert_one(data)
        return str(result.inserted_id)

# In Agent Layer
await self.llm_call_repo.create(llm_call_data)
```

### ❌ WRONG

```python
# DON'T access database directly
await self.mongo_db.llm_calls.insert_one(data)  # Bypasses repository!
```

**Rule**: No component can access MongoDB directly. All access through repository classes.

