## Tool & Agent Contracts

**Agents must rely on tool/agent contracts for inputs/outputs.**

### ✅ CORRECT
```python
# Tool metadata includes input/output schemas
tool = ToolSpec(
    name="read_file",
    input_schema=ReadFileArgs,
    output_schema=ReadFileResult
)
```

### ❌ WRONG
```python
# Agent invents expected output shape
expected = {"content": "..."}  # Not sourced from tool contract
```

**Rule**: Input arguments and output shapes come from tool/agent definitions, not Agent assumptions.

